# PrimeProperty Next Client Codemap

Last verified: 2026-09-01

This file is the high-level map of the repository. Keep it focused on stable
boundaries and update it whenever routes, data sources, shared providers, or
domain entry points change.

## Quick orientation

PrimeProperty is a Next.js 15 App Router application for browsing Indonesian
property listings, viewing agents and articles, saving and comparing
properties, and submitting contact leads.

The application has four main layers:

1. `src/app` owns routes, layouts, route-local components, metadata, and
   structured data.
2. `src/components` owns shared providers and reusable UI.
3. `src/lib/api` owns REST and DatoCMS GraphQL access.
4. `src/lib/hooks` and `src/lib/types` own TanStack Query configuration and
   shared domain contracts.

```text
Browser / Next.js route
        |
        +-- Server component ----------> src/lib/api ----------> REST API
        |                                      |                DatoCMS
        |                                      +--------------> S3
        |
        +-- Client component ----------> src/lib/hooks
                                               |
                                               +--> TanStack Query
                                               +--> src/lib/api
```

